<title>USA: MEAD NAMES JEROME TATAR CHAIRMAN, CEO.</title>
<headline>MEAD NAMES JEROME TATAR CHAIRMAN, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mead Corp said on Thursday its board of directors named Mead president Jerome Tatar as chairman, chief executive officer and president, effective November 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Tatar will succeed Steven Mason, who has been chairman since 1992 and has elected to retire early.</p>
<p>Tatar was elected president and chief operating officer by the board of directors in April 1996, Mead said in a statement. He had been serving as vice-president-operating officer since July 1994.</p>
